{
  "about": [
    "One adversarial table for a link destination's query (managed-site contract 0.41.0), judged by three implementations that must agree:",
    "site-starter packages/managed-site-contract (test/cms-link-query-cases.json, run by test/link-query-destinations.test.ts) and megaseo-web",
    "(src/server/db/managed_sites/cms_link_query_cases.json: the CMS rule public.managed_site_cms_link_destination_violation on a real database, its",
    "TypeScript twin src/util/cms_link_rules.ts, and the contract package Site Guard parses). Keep this file byte-identical in both repositories.",
    "base is a link field's constraints; a case's constraints are shallow-merged over it; a member whose value is the string \"ABSENT\" is deleted instead.",
    "pageId and otherPageId are static pages every runner declares; only pageId has an allowedQueries entry in base.",
    "destinationCases: a link field value (label 'Get Started', target same_window). reason is the CMS's refusal; the package is held to outcome only.",
    "policyCases: whether constraints parse. contract is the package's verdict; cms is whether the CMS rule reads the policy (a policy it refuses is 'link policy is invalid').",
    "The CMS reads a policy only as far as admission needs: a duplicate the contract refuses admits nothing the deduplicated policy does not, and Site Guard refuses that contract before the CMS sees it.",
    "spellingCases: a query and the one string every renderer writes for it (managedLinkQueryString), names in ascending code-unit order."
  ],
  "pageId": "page_10000000000000000000000000",
  "otherPageId": "page_20000000000000000000000000",
  "base": {
    "labelConstraints": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 40,
      "newlines": "forbid"
    },
    "authority": "internal_or_external",
    "allowedSchemes": [
      "https"
    ],
    "allowedExternalHosts": [
      "example.com"
    ],
    "fragmentPolicy": "declared",
    "allowedFragments": [
      "form"
    ],
    "allowedQueries": [
      {
        "pageId": "page_10000000000000000000000000",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "type",
            "values": [
              "strategy",
              "rfp",
              "expert",
              "custom-network",
              "consultation"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "source",
            "values": [
              "header",
              "footer"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "allowedTargets": [
      "same_window"
    ]
  },
  "policyCases": [
